    <title>Vol.23 从安徽小镇到入围理想国文学奖：一个女孩的上海突围</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b090925faf368659ebdb8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b090925faf368659ebdb8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 21:20:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年宝珀理想国文学奖长名单已经公布，青年作家水笑莹的作品《到上海去》成功入围！本期，我们将邀请她，以及《到上海去》的责任编辑许龚燕，还有中国财经报记者傅晓，一起谈谈当代人对“到上海去”的执念与怀念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期还将在评论区选出3-5个精选评论，每人送出一本《到上海去》！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgTreT1Umf0f79r-tLSbtAxc4J-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你听完本期，对本书感兴趣，欢迎购买：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://item.m.jd.com/product/14443369.html?utm_term=CopyURL_shareidfdb745a226f0c8cf2eacffebbb61aca02af4438717563967003879_shangxiang_none&amp;gx=RnAomTM2bTbYmclEqoZ3X0frChPZ3tM&amp;utm_source=iosapp&amp;utm_campaign=t_335139774&amp;utm_medium=appshare&amp;ad_od=share&amp;gxd=RnAolTMLbzDcmpoXqdJ3Dn4UKgJztMGAS5vNkyZ-YsVj0Cza3fDR1yjCiOE56Sg&amp;jkl=@X2QwaA0EpYtZ@" data-url="https://item.m.jd.com/product/14443369.html?utm_term=CopyURL_shareidfdb745a226f0c8cf2eacffebbb61aca02af4438717563967003879_shangxiang_none&amp;gx=RnAomTM2bTbYmclEqoZ3X0frChPZ3tM&amp;utm_source=iosapp&amp;utm_campaign=t_335139774&amp;utm_medium=appshare&amp;ad_od=share&amp;gxd=RnAolTMLbzDcmpoXqdJ3Dn4UKgJztMGAS5vNkyZ-YsVj0Cza3fDR1yjCiOE56Sg&amp;jkl=@X2QwaA0EpYtZ@"><span>购书链接：《到上海去》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎阅读傅晓对水笑莹的专访：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hhB7U_wHAz0P23-R4YTkHA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hhB7U_wHAz0P23-R4YTkHA"><span>“到上海去”之后呢？水笑莹讲述两代女性的城市挣扎</span></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>如果你对写作阅读感兴趣，希望进入我们的写作工坊一起学习，欢迎在评论区留下你的足迹，或者私信本期主持人Beanie！</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一本小说集是如何编辑成功的？文学编辑谈谈背后的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>记者眼中的作家是什么样的？三个关键词概括水笑莹</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>安徽中老年妇女为何前往上海？如何前往上海？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>年轻一代还对前往上海有执念吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>写作与生活达到什么状态，才能获得心灵的平衡？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如果你现在对刚来上海的你说一句话，你会说什么？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>策划&amp;主持&amp;后期：Beanie</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：水笑莹、许龚燕、傅晓</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>sweetdiary</span></p>]]></description>
