    <guid isPermaLink="false">6818a58f47ebeede7edc50b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一（人人人人）假期结束，明天重归打工生活（落泪）。不知道大家这次五一假期有没有出去玩？有哪些值得吐槽的故事呢？本期没有飞行嘉宾，是我们三个主播难得的一次闲聊，一起坐下来聊聊旅行中的【荒谬】故事~</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>如果你喜欢我们的播客，欢迎加上【偶然事件】小助手，进入听友群，和我们一起聊天！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我们将定期举办【拯救孤独写作计划】读写活动！</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhW1aYDcOMMsAm1qMloOzPc17h0j.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期会谈到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Beanie：一个人旅行的快乐，你们到底懂不懂啊！？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>树一：去印尼，看火山，立人设，假装自己是一个砍价高手！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>骑士：被邀自驾上盘山公路，自己竟然才是真正的“老司机”？好荒谬……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你有想要在旅游地定居的冲动吗？（主要讨论：日本）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>旅游博主会不会增加一些莫名其妙的滤镜？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我们对“诗与远方”的期待是动力，还是束缚？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>内容：树一、骑士、Beanie</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>如果你想参与我们的阅读与文学活动，欢迎关注小红书：</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xsec_token=YBfwYaRYt7AvmJnYfnmJZk2uyW-YHdNOmDZTTekJrsDrI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445420&amp;share_id=d9767fec6f144547a934ad576c44a1ec" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xsec_token=YBfwYaRYt7AvmJnYfnmJZk2uyW-YHdNOmDZTTekJrsDrI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445420&amp;share_id=d9767fec6f144547a934ad576c44a1ec"><em><span>树一</span></em></a><em><span>、</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e1ee4580000000001006092?xsec_token=YBdXd_IluTBShyS-L2tSCHwEwiF6SZcNXYElueiJ2mRx4=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445473&amp;share_id=7003a1d3bdb447f1a144450bfaf140fe" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e1ee4580000000001006092?xsec_token=YBdXd_IluTBShyS-L2tSCHwEwiF6SZcNXYElueiJ2mRx4=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445473&amp;share_id=7003a1d3bdb447f1a144450bfaf140fe"><em><span>骑士</span></em></a><em><span>、</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6078e9a4000000000101cb5e?xsec_token=YBbkGeFjOBf9LMDd0vApbDIHHP51tkOufd-88CTBJ4U4k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445490&amp;share_id=39889ac90ed84187a564254f3e85d50e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6078e9a4000000000101cb5e?xsec_token=YBbkGeFjOBf9LMDd0vApbDIHHP51tkOufd-88CTBJ4U4k=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1746445490&amp;share_id=39889ac90ed84187a564254f3e85d50e"><em><span>Beanie</span></em></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：Beanie</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>BGM：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2022657409&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18jhg0N4lo0k5AFZ0GBv3WJhDyHnyEUOZE=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2022657409&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18jhg0N4lo0k5AFZ0GBv3WJhDyHnyEUOZE="><span>我们想去的地方</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
