  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 上海教师辞职去巴黎，是流亡还是新的开始？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6559a0bac9e7cfe025d0b580</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6559a0bac9e7cfe025d0b580</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期青年生活图鉴的嘉宾是“偶然事件”第一期就和大家聊过天的老朋友——泱泱。</span></p><p><span>她在今年放弃了上海某双语学校的教职，独自前往巴黎读语言班。用她自己的话说，“前往巴黎是新的流亡与开始”。</span></p><p><span>今天，和泱泱一起聊聊她的选择、她在巴黎的生活与感受。</span></p><p><span>（如果大家对本期播客感兴趣，欢迎订阅&amp;分享～更欢迎大家在公告中加入我们）</span></p><p><span>收听定位小贴士：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 为什么辞职来巴黎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 巴黎初印象</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> 在巴黎遇见的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 从巴黎到那不勒斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 语言班的申请流程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> 巴黎留学的开销</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 母语是我在巴黎的家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> 在巴黎重获生活的“现实感”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">49:37</a> 独自留学让我认清真实自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 未来的打算</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> 对想要裸辞朋友们的建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3696">61:36</a> 干货推荐：巴黎好吃好玩的东西</span></p><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><p><span>PM｜后期制作：树一</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>树一（小红书：爱看树的</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1699716730" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1699716730"><span>树一</span></a><span>）</span></p><p><span>泱泱（小红书：泱泱教读写</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57b019b55e87e74ceab8141e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8&amp;apptime=1700445422" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57b019b55e87e74ceab8141e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8&amp;apptime=1700445422"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a><span>）</span></p><p><span>【BGM】Mystery of Love</span></p>]]></description>
