  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 坠落的审判：爱人，是杀死我的头号嫌犯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654f9f85aa96f6e64272b8f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654f9f85aa96f6e64272b8f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Nov 2023 15:36:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年入选第76届戛纳电影节主竞赛单元，并获得金棕榈奖的电影《坠落的审判》，到底讲了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们为大家解读，</span><strong><span>这部电影中无迹可寻的爱情与罪证横行的婚姻。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（如果大家对本期播客感兴趣，欢迎订阅&amp;分享～更欢迎大家在公告中加入我们）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听定位小贴士：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART1 我们对电影的总体感受</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 骑士：同样身为女作家，我首先感受到了恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 玄雀：电影中的婚姻关系，让我从窒息到无力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a> 树一 ：“介质”能否转述情感？人能否真正了解自我？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART2 电影情节深层剖析</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 丈夫的死：他是一个被男权社会阉割的善良弱者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> 妻子的性取向：她为什么被导演设定为双性恋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 谋杀：妻子到底是不是导致丈夫死亡的施害者？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART3 虽然未婚，但我们对婚姻也要有思考</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 当我们在婚姻中犯下不可挽回的错误，还有重掌生活的权力吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 婚姻中不确定的真相到底重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">42:53</a> 隐瞒婚姻的真相，或许还有生活的出路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> 婚姻的困难是：你认不清自己，还想依靠另一个人来认清自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 婚姻的本质是一场赌博！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 当作家们结为夫妻，会嫉妒对方的才华吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3313">55:13</a> 两部相关电影：《婚姻故事》很庸俗，而《婚姻生活》道出了婚姻是“遮羞布”的现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a> 婚姻还有好处吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 如果我们变得庸俗，婚姻会更好过一点吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>PM｜后期制作：Beanie</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span><br><span>Beanie（小红书：偶然事件aha!）</span></p><span></span><p><span>树一（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1699716730" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b2bccc911be102b14e7e0c8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=6078e9a4000000000101cb5e&amp;apptime=1699716730"><span>树一</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>骑士（小红书：狼狈相骑士）</span></p><span></span><p><span>玄雀（小红书：玄雀）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=16158582&amp;userid=122758713" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=16158582&amp;userid=122758713"><span>P.I.M.P</span></a><span> &amp; </span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1409490569&amp;userid=122758713" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1409490569&amp;userid=122758713"><span>PIMP</span></a></p>]]></description>
